---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Changelog" description="RepoTunnel release history and current public release notes.">
  <div class="container listing-head"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>Changelog</span><h1>Release history</h1><p>Public release notes derived from the RepoTunnel repository's changelog.</p></div>
  <div class="container section-tight">
    <div class="release-row"><div><div class="release-version">v0.4.1</div><div class="release-date">2026-10-05</div></div><div><strong>First public 0.4.x release</strong><div class="release-date">Phone Access, large-project reads, managed-process reliability, browser mutation receipts, expanded Continuity, Team Mode and Video Production.</div></div><a class="btn btn-sm" href="/changelog/0.4.1/">Read notes</a></div>
    <div class="release-row"><div><div class="release-version">v0.3.1</div><div class="release-date">2026-09-06</div></div><div><strong>Reliability and editor quality</strong><div class="release-date">Projects/Continuity layout fixes, editor behavior, responsiveness and AI Workspace cleanup improvements.</div></div></div>
    <div class="release-row"><div><div class="release-version">v0.3.0</div><div class="release-date">2026-09-05</div></div><div><strong>Continuity, updates and Direct HTTPS</strong><div class="release-date">Resume v2, updater infrastructure, TLS/Direct HTTPS hardening and accountless product state.</div></div></div>
    <div class="release-row"><div><div class="release-version">v0.2.0</div><div class="release-date">2026-09-02</div></div><div><strong>AI Workspace and release hardening</strong><div class="release-date">Isolated AI Workspace, CodeMirror editor, monitoring improvements, history and cross-platform packaging.</div></div></div>
    <p class="release-source"><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Yashwanth034/RepoTunnel/releases">Browse older releases on GitHub</a></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
